{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的音乐感受细节和意象递进明显不如X，尤其S02、S04、S10、S14，少了许多能跟着具体乐句、声部和情绪转折走的细腻提示。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分工更明确：左边先让人抓住人物正在经历什么、为什么这样，右边补充身体感受和情绪变化，普通观众在有限时间里更容易建立完整理解。X的音乐感受明显更丰富，水波、小船、光线、声部和情绪起伏之间也有更细的呼应，但感受短语过于密集，部分意思反复叠加，容易让观众忙于扫词而顾不上听音乐。总体我选Y，因为它更容易让人跟住人物关系的发展；但如果只论感受的细腻程度和音乐细节的捕捉，X更胜一筹。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a252c0c5-3b1f-4c31-be04-01b928a300c8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T044806014305Z", "elapsed_seconds": 33.813, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:48:39.833260+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8b78d4ba34ab3954b57ee17db2b0fce5722493ba57ab16102be327ca4848de69", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683